# Downloaded assets, not sources.
#
# `public/models` is 1.1 GB of NASA public-domain meshes and `public/textures`
# 13 MB of imagery; both are fetched by scripts in this repo rather than authored
# in it, and both are optional at runtime — the app synthesises every texture
# procedurally and falls back to compound placeholder hulls. The READMEs that
# document the expected file names are kept, and so is the generated catalogue,
# because `src/gfx/modelsManifest.js` is what the HUD selector reads.
public/models/*
!public/models/README.md
public/textures/*
!public/textures/README.md
public/draco/
